WEBVTT

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.160
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.120
One, two, three

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:44.540
Undead tree

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.460
What truth

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.460
I'll come true

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:57.140
Wow...

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:01.430
I see that bright light

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:08.020
This is all I have

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:12.610
What did you say?
I know

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.110
Why do you say?

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:22.120
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:29.210
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:33.380
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:37.090
Survive of vision

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.350
Unfinished heaven

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:44.020
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:48.270
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:52.980
Survive of vision

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:00.870
Master...

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.330
Are we through already?

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:12.130
This... is the Itto-ryu.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:19.930
Good morning.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.060
Mr. Yatsushiba...

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:30.600
Itto-ryu...

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:33.980
Much akin to a pup in its cuteness.

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:36.070
-What?!
-You...

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.280
Why don't you come and bite me like dogs?

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.240
How pitiful, Yatsushiba.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:46.950
Welcome, Rokki.

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.960
You've traveled a great way to get here.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:55.920
You must be exhausted, let me put you to rest.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:06.060
Here I was thinking this was but
a small roadblock, then he shows up.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.220
Who is that?

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:09.100
Our greatest foe.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.560
All of you, stand back.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.060
He could kill every one of you on his own.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.830
Hey, you furry oaf, this way!

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.660
I'll take you on over there.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.700
I'll draw them off.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.620
You all must flee.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.040
When it's all over,

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.880
come to meet me.

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:40.130
Mr. Ariusu, Mr. Koda,

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.630
Yatoin...

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:45.970
Of everyone here, you are
one step above in terms of sword prowess.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.350
Please, go after him.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.270
Mr. Abayama, I'm sorry.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.810
This Itto-ryu of ours

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:57.980
truly does belong to you.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:19.460
Mr. Abayama, allow us to--

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:21.920
Hear me now.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.510
If you dare try to butt in

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.890
while I'm in pitched combat,

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.470
I will slay you.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.230
I swear I was out of his range.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.940
There must be something to that lengthy blade.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.940
Perhaps you can't tell,

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.150
Mr. Sumo Wrestler.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.700
A corrosive liquid?

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.300
Gi--!

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:13.930
I wasn't expecting it to extend.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:20.360
Now you're just a little smoother than before, right?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.330
Overwhelming...

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.800
Those things of yours,

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:52.430
if you don't let them fly a little further forward,
they're just sickles.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.060
That's true.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:57.020
They won't offer any meaningful resistance.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:02.570
Are you sure you're the same baldy
that once assassinated the Itto-ryu?

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.700
Well, I can clearly tell you're no grunt.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:10.320
These sickles are normally
for retaliating against others.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.580
It would seem I'm not yet accustomed.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:14.370
Oh, I see.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.500
But is that really the case?

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:19.670
Is it the weapon's fault? Your own ability?

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.710
Or maybe your heart is what wavers.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:25.550
-Silence.
-That face.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:29.090
Don't tell me, that woman is pregnant?

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.800
I said be silent!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.760
What a shame, Giichi.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:36.310
The Mugai-ryu's strongest man...

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.980
What's this?

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.570
You have the time to take a rest?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.740
Chains, sickles.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:50.950
Sword, chains, sickles.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:54.700
It's no good. Two hands aren't enough.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:57.870
What's that?

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.210
Woman! You trying to meddle in this?

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.710
Wha--?! You...!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.640
Curse you...

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.350
Koda! Don't get heated!

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:16.720
You're an easy target!

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.230
-Die!
-I'm sorry!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.770
Mr. Abayama!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.370
Koda!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:09.690
Lady...

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.650
What, you brat?

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.870
You resemble my mother.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.660
Before you die,

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.620
at least once...

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.040
You see,

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:28.500
when I was 14, I tried to violate my stepmother
and got thrown out of the house.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:31.550
That smell, those mannerisms.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:35.970
It was all my mother's fault
that my heart was thrown into disarray.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.850
I desired strength.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.680
The strength to kill my father and brother.

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:45.650
The Itto-ryu took in a boy like me.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.690
All that mattered was strength.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.610
You piece of...

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.780
Mother belongs to me.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.030
Mother was the one who seduced me.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:58.910
They said you were pregnant, didn't they?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:01.870
Why would you have a baby when you have me?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.170
I'll just have to remove it.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.380
The child inside me

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.170
is a cursed child I've considered aborting
countless times,

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.630
but that doesn't matter.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.090
-I'm going to kill this brat!
 -Don't move!

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.810
Are you all right?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.270
I think.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.080
I'm still fine...

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.450
Hey.

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:22.450
I saw a distinct weakness within your heart.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.200
So why

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.330
am I the one lying here

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:29.460
dying an unsightly death?

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.000
The moment that man named Koda
passed between us,

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.210
I too saw a weakness in your heart.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:40.180
Both you and I are weaklings.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.180
What decided our fates

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.430
was naught but the age disparity.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.230
Satake!

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:00.660
You...!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:01.870
Amen.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:07.910
Is that...?

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.880
Are you shipwrecked too?

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:21.590
It makes me sick to hear a person
speak the language of my homeland.

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:26.600
Our similarities end at our shipwrecks.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:29.520
I am ever grateful

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:33.400
that the Itto-ryu took me in.

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:37.780
Thanks to them, I didn't have to live
as a dog of the Shogunate.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.490
I'll bet.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:46.580
Katsumata Shingoro of the Itto-ryu
shall face you now!

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:53.170
Sorry. I don't speak Japanese.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.210
Every one of the Itto-ryu

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.220
have won countless battles

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:04.800
without any teaching, using only our sense of smell.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.770
It's the name of all we've accumulated.

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:20.650
Damn you!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:26.240
Impossible. Just how much weight is he carrying?

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:34.620
Acid?

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:37.880
Exactly.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.300
Well, I didn't expect you'd back down.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:50.020
The closer I get to him, the more likely...

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:02.490
Too bad. This was my real ace in the hole.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.450
Thank you.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.120
Daggers are much more gruesome.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.910
Don't act tough.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.830
Don't underestimate

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.920
the Itto-ryu!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.970
I am the head of the Itto-ryu, Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:30.060
I am much obliged for your long journey here.

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:33.930
Don't make such a pitiful face. Even if I die,

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.310
you are all the Itto-ryu.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:40.400
I'm tired of seeing the young die before my eyes.

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:43.150
Just try dying before me, I dare you.

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:45.110
I'll kill you myself.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.530
I'm sorry, Mr. Abayama.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.500
Long live the Itto-ryu.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:12.310
You've come to meet me, Saburo.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.770
No...

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:19.650
We still have Kagehisa.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:30.910
I do not recall summoning you here.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:35.120
It's a decision we made for ourselves.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.000
You fool.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:50.890
Starting with Abayama, we have annihilated
the 12 Itto-ryu that were in Mitoji.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:55.060
Then all that remains is the task of Kagehisa Anotsu?

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:02.940
The Itto-ryu's boat should be somewhere here
in Nakaminato.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.570
Or perhaps they sought out a captain after landing.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:14.620
No, I doubt they would use a merchant ship or a sailboat
and spend precious time unloading and loading cargo.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.540
So you're saying their private boat
would have already left?

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:23.040
All of the long trip and short trip ships
that we can see before us,

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:26.250
cut down the entire crews of each of them.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.630
Do not discriminate between the common laborers.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:54.530
You bastards!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.830
What are you doing?!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.480
A hired guard?

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:27.190
-Sickening for a ship.
-Mr. Doma.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:30.780
Hey, lend a hand. Put a hole in this ship's hull.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.990
-We're sinking this one too.
-Yes, sir.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.670
A woman?

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.640
And they were such kind people...

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:10.440
You have done well to survive this long
with such weapons.

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.550
We're heading back, Tarieshin.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.180
We'll leave that woman to Habaki.

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:37.390
We're not up to it.

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:45.770
Come quietly!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.020
Yes, sir!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:50.730
Do not fuss. This is but a terrible misunderstanding.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.650
-That's a mighty brazen--
-I am the new head guard,

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:56.200
Kagimura Habaki.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:18:00.580
I am here under Shogunate orders
to pursue criminals.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:04.700
Itto-ryu. I'm sure you have heard the name.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:09.920
Behold, each of my subordinates
has had a blood-written seal prepared.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.840
An elder's signature can be found on the left.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.010
That is proof of the decree.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.930
-Take a close look if you must.
-Wha--?

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.050
The Itto-ryu,

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:24.350
the one you should truly apprehend is there.

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:33.230
Arrest her!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.740
Habaki.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.150
That one's trouble.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.750
Lord Habaki. I shall handle this.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.270
This is bad.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.770
Seven will die here.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.450
Divine intervention?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.960
That was close.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:35.420
I was aiming for the moment you swung your blade.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.510
Manji.

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:48.310
My head!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.640
How scary!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:20:00.990
In that single instant? You monster.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.120
Hey.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:08.830
You haven't looked so pitiful
since the very first time we met.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:11.120
How's Kagehisa Anotsu?

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.580
Good grief. If he were here,

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:18.590
I would have gladly let him take over this duty.

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:34.100
Did you... do something to that water?

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:36.440
It's a medicine. Named...

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:38.900
Asaemon Syrup.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:41.900
A person's guts...?

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:44.280
Yeah, what of it?

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.700
It's more use to you than to him now.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.160
Your eyes say you don't care if you die.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:54.000
It's what I hate most about you.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.000
Why save me?

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:01.130
It's not for me. It's because of that kid.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:06.010
She thinks that something about you
just doesn't fit with the Itto-ryu.

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:07.600
Probably.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.970
Mr. Manji...

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:14.520
Looks like we've got a tiresome woman on our hands.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.310
Thank you, Mr. Giichi.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:22.240
The Habaki I know will not be taken aback by this.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.780
In that case,

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:25.360
I'm going down there for a bit.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.490
Hold it!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:30.330
You going over there won't do anything.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:31.950
Ms. Hyakurin,

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:35.210
I have saved Mr. Manji on many occasions.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:40.170
I believe today will be the last day
I can do that for him.

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:54.720
ACT TWENTY TWO - TEN FINAL PUSHES
